ixture-only新tmpfs独立cluster原aos_app迁移owner/161门未修改，原两setup失败保留，临时库清理且仅exact容器停止。视频exact根缺失8commandsfalse、未知参数/租户和原幂等历史门保留；实际新版API/页/经营仍待。\"], \"response_requirements\": {\"format\": \"只返回单个原始JSON，禁止围栏。response_requirements.exact_identity_to_copy内全部五字段和值包括baseline.files完整字典原样放到顶层；不能省略files/缩写hash/改identity。再添加verdict/findings/next_safe_step；逐claim评审不改变材料。\", \"required_fields\": [\"request_id\", \"task_id\", \"owner\", \"kind\", \"baseline\", \"verdict\", \"findings\", \"next_safe_step\"], \"next_safe_step\": \"必须是非空具体安全下一步字符串\", \"exact_identity_to_copy\": {\"request_id\": \"qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013-r3\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\", \"kind\": \"quality\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"a353556ba98ad25858a31813a0bf32f599156787\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002017\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-plan.md.txt\": \"a71de0e53b8242748bdbc8abbc4ee4fd66fd714aec2f131cf6a56c51672006ff\", \".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-transitive-read-audit.json.txt\": \"a895e230ebd0396978436811df0efd28745db5dbb8feeb57a57292327d9033e9\", \".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-native-two-r1.json.txt\": \"7789d9896eacad950bd6057619aa3dc4289bd885045d774a68468067393a74c7\", \".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-compatibility.json.txt\": \"078ec725379c129fa0fd638349034f089de9f26210bb8020d9aa55f2cc5b274a\", \".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-tests-isolated-r3.txt.txt\": \"a4163e86526768a29e95cb5a9b78ab99e7afac3a18ac1d20a3e08037367d19b9\", \".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-isolated-pg-terminal.json.txt\": \"782a3f5544fb2ebb0f83fd2261d9c5e4bfdc30ef49c4a3125793632436e4d8fc\", \".evidence/qyh-media-aux-read-dependencies-20261013/review-material-router-diff.txt.txt\": \"8e5381d20288aab14